---
source: crates/core/tests/distros.rs
expression: "tasks_plan(&sys, ids)"
---
Bootcraft plan for Linux Mint (9 tasks)

[1/9] Update the system  (system.update)
    $ env DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get -y -o Dpkg::Options::=--force-confdef -o Dpkg::Options::=--force-confold -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=300 update
    $ env DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get -y -o Dpkg::Options::=--force-confdef -o Dpkg::Options::=--force-confold -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=300 full-upgrade

[2/9] NVIDIA 580 legacy driver  (gpu.nvidia)
    $ apt-get install -y ubuntu-drivers-common
    $ apt-get install -y the newest nvidia-driver-<branch> that ubuntu-drivers lists, up to 580

[3/9] Hardware video decoding on NVIDIA  (gpu.nvidia-vaapi)
    $ apt-get install -y nvidia-vaapi-driver

[4/9] Flatpak with Flathub  (flatpak.flathub)
    $ apt-get install -y flatpak
    $ flatpak remote-add --if-not-exists --system flathub https://dl.flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo

[5/9] Media codecs and thumbnails  (media.codecs)
    $ write /var/cache/bootcraft/mscorefonts.debconf
    $ debconf-set-selections /var/cache/bootcraft/mscorefonts.debconf  (skipped if ttf-mscorefonts-installer is already installed)
    $ apt-get install -y mint-meta-codecs gstreamer1.0-vaapi ffmpegthumbnailer

[6/9] Archive tools  (tools.archive)
    $ apt-get install -y 7zip unrar unzip zip

[7/9] NTFS and exFAT drives  (tools.drives)
    $ apt-get install -y ntfs-3g exfatprogs

[8/9] Fonts for every language and emoji  (system.fonts)
    $ apt-get install -y fonts-noto-core fonts-noto-cjk fonts-noto-color-emoji

[9/9] Firmware updates  (system.firmware)
    $ apt-get install -y fwupd

A reboot is required afterwards.
